    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1147914268": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 842838124,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "It’s beautiful, really. The beach, the atmosphere... it’s like stepping out of real life for a little while.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "346119151": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1339228390,
   "children": [
    -1006453045
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Did you and {D} ever go on a vacation like this?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1006453045": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 346119151,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Not quite like this. We had a few trips, but they were more about practicality—family visits, stuff like that. Nothing so carefree. This is... different.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1535864250": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1339228390,
   "children": [
    -154563800
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Are you hungry? Should we also order something to eat?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-154563800": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1535864250,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "No, I’m good. I think the drinks will be plenty for now. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1387542900": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1339228390,
   "children": [
    1590898645
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Let’s just relax with our drinks.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1590898645": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1387542900,
